From fd9184cf3ec046fafa62fd8583842507f709687b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Duncan Brawley <duncan.brawley@imgtec.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 14:11:54 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] pvr: Support pipeline executable properties
 VkPipelineCreateFlags2 flags

Add support for pipeline executable properties VkPipelineCreateFlags2
variants as required by VK_KHR_maintenance5.

Remove `dEQP-VK.api.array.oversized_array.core.get_pipeline_executable_statistics`
from axe-1-16m and bxs-4-64 fails lists.

Fixes: ad14a81cc7b ("pvr: advertise VK_KHR_maintenance5")
Signed-off-by: Duncan Brawley <duncan.brawley@imgtec.com>
Reviewed-by: Simon Perretta <simon.perretta@imgtec.com>
Part-of: <https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/merge_requests/45696>
(cherry picked from commit 4e32ef686bb57be709fa176e62b2e72a884fe886)

Conflicts:
	src/imagination/ci/axe-1-16m-fails.txt
	src/imagination/ci/bxs-4-64-fails.txt
Link: https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/commit/fd9184cf3ec046fafa62fd8583842507f709687b
[ adapted: dropped .pick_status.json, not in the 26.3.0 tarball or bookkeeping only ]
